            "name": "Walmart Retrieve All Report Requests",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p style=\"color:red; font-size:larger\">GET <walmartAuthServerUrl>/v3/reports/reportRequests</p>\n\nThis API request fetches a list of all report requests based on search criteria like `reportType`, `reportVersion`, and `requestStatus`.\n\nUse the query parameters to define the search and fetch details of report requests created in the last 30 days only.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
